# Resolver and compiler: building a workspace set-up from its parts
error-res-bundle-corrupt = The saved set-up is damaged. Build it again.
error-res-bundle-not-found = ordin can't find that saved set-up. Build it again.
error-res-closure-too-large = That set-up pulls in too many parts. Remove some and try again.
error-res-conflict = Two different parts want the same place in this set-up. Keep only one.
error-res-dependency-cycle = Some parts depend on each other in a circle, or are nested too deeply. Remove the loop.
error-res-digest-mismatch = A part has changed since it was recorded. Build the set-up again.
error-res-draft-constituent = A part of this set-up is still a draft. Approve it first.
error-res-lock-mismatch = The set-up no longer matches what was recorded. Build it again.
error-res-lock-part-unavailable = A recorded part is gone, withdrawn or changed. Build the set-up again.
error-res-loop-missing = This set-up needs a control loop and has none. Add one.
error-res-loop-mode-escape = The control loop uses a mode that this set-up doesn't allow. Choose another loop.
error-res-loop-multiple = This set-up has more than one control loop. Keep only one.
error-res-loop-not-permitted = That control loop isn't one this set-up allows. Choose another.
error-res-manifest-invalid = A part's description isn't in the form ordin expects. Correct it and try again.
error-res-memory-cardinality = This set-up has more than one memory choice. Keep only one.
error-res-not-installable = That can't be set up as a workspace profile. Choose a workspace profile.
error-res-overlay-cardinality = Two options were chosen where only one is allowed. Keep only one.
error-res-overlay-not-allowed = That option isn't one this set-up offers. Choose another.
error-res-overlay-not-applicable = That option doesn't apply to this agent. Choose another.
error-res-pack-not-allowed = That practice pack isn't allowed for this agent. Choose another.
error-res-part-withdrawn = A part of this set-up has been withdrawn and nothing replaces it. Choose a replacement.
error-res-reference-unresolved = A part refers to something ordin can't find. Check the reference.
error-res-required-overlay-missing = A required option hasn't been chosen. Choose one.
error-res-required-pack-unsettled = A required practice pack can't be settled and isn't left for you to choose. Choose one.
error-res-root-not-approved = The starting profile is still a draft or has been retired. Choose an approved profile.
error-res-root-not-found = ordin can't find that starting profile. Choose another.
error-res-source-already-bound = The source of parts has already been set. It can only be set once.
error-res-source-ambiguous = The same name appears in two sources. Remove one.
error-res-source-not-bound = No source of parts has been set yet. Set one and try again.
error-res-source-unavailable = ordin can't read the source of parts just now. Try again in a moment.
error-res-store-write-failed = ordin couldn't save the set-up to disk. Check there is free space and try again.
error-res-tool-policy-invalid = A connection in this set-up is missing a name, a type or a valid way to connect. Correct it and try again.
